      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "green = Dokploy app (swarm svc)\nblue = compose, on dokploy-network\ngray = compose, NOT on dokploy-network\nviolet = shared datastore (compose)\nnetwork membership per live docker ps\nprometheus also scrapes blocky,\ntandra-api, kivo; gatus checks ~all",
